{"id":2059,"level":79,"name":"Комбінація (1)","group":"Комбінація","format":27,"description":"<p><span style='background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);'>A new color, that means new lessons! To truly understand chess there is still an incredible amount to discover. One new term that you are going to encounter a great deal on the bronze level is 'combination'.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style='background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);'>The term 'combination' is used a lot in chess books. Actually it is a collective term for all kinds of tricks. A general characteristic of combinations is several themes are 'combined'. For example, in a combination you can sometimes apply a pin and a double attack at the same time. Another typical aspect of combinations is that a player temporarily invests material, but has calculated that the investment will be paid back with interest within a few moves.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style='background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);'>A successful combination almost always leads to material gain.&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style='background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);'>What do you have to do?</strong></p><p><span style='background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);'>Try to apply different tactical patterns that will eventually make you win material.</span></p><p><br></p>","assignment":"","stickerID":95,"examples":[{"fen":"r1b4k/pp3rb1/2np3p/4nppN/8/4PN1P/P3BPPB/R2R2K1 b - - 0 20","pgn":"20... Nxf3+ 21. Bxf3 Bxa1 * ","text":"<p>Помінявши коня на f3, чорні створюють відкритий напад. Туру в кутку втрачено, і чорні виграють.</p>","format":27},{"fen":"3r2k1/1pp3pp/8/p4b2/2P2Q2/1Pq1BpP1/P4P1P/2R3K1 b - - 0 26","pgn":"26... Qxc1+ 27. Bxc1 Rd1# * ","text":"<p>Задній ранг білих послаблений. Чорний може скористатися цим за допомогою комбінації. <strong>1.Qxc1+! Bxc1 2.Rd1# </strong>і білим поставлено мат.</p>","format":27},{"fen":"4kb2/p4pp1/3q4/3rp3/1PQ5/6P1/P2N1PK1/3R4 w - - 0 30","pgn":"30. Ne4 {[%csl Gc4,Gd1,Rd5,Rd6,Ge4][%cal Ge4d6,Gd1d5,Gc4d5]} Rxd1 31. Nxd6+ {[%csl Gd6]} * ","text":"","format":27}],"puzzles":[{"id":77303,"fen":"r2r2k1/pbp1bpp1/1p2p2p/4P3/2P1N2q/P2B1Q2/1P1R1PPP/3R2K1 b - - 0 23","pgn":"{[%csl Rd3,Re4][%evp 0,3,-192,-206,-208,-203]}   {Q=3} 23... Rxd3 {P=1} 24. Qxd3  {Q=4} Bxe4 {P=2} (24... Qxe4) * ","format":27,"texts":["Білі з інтересом повертають матеріал.","Білі з інтересом повертають матеріал.","Білий слон є ключовим захисником.","Час заробляти!"],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":80986,"fen":"5rk1/2q2pp1/2pb2p1/pr1n2B1/3PR3/1BP2Q1P/5PP1/R5K1 w - - 0 24","pgn":"{[%csl Rb5,Gc3,Rd5,Gf3][%evp 0,3,220,232,241,256]} 24. c4 Rxb3 {[%csl Rb3]} 25. Qxb3 * ","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":80985,"fen":"2kr3r/pp3ppp/2p1p3/3nP3/1qB1Q3/8/PPPR1PPP/2KR4 w - - 0 16","pgn":"{[%csl Rb4,Gc4,Rd5,Ge4][%evp 0,3,348,349,350,350]} 16. Bxd5 Qxe4 {[%csl Re4]} 17. Bxe4 * ","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":77305,"fen":"4r1k1/3r2qp/p5p1/1p3p2/2pPbQ2/P1P4B/1P4PP/R3R1K1 b - - 0 25","pgn":"{[%csl Rf4,Rh3][%evp 0,5,-168,-189,-252,-297,-305,-282]} {Q=2} 25... g5 26. Qf2 {Q=3} g4 {P=1} 27. Bxg4 {Q=4} fxg4 (27... Qxg4) * ","format":27,"texts":["The white bishop is now trapped.","фігури з обмеженою рухливістю можуть потрапити в пастку.","фігури з обмеженою рухливістю можуть потрапити в пастку.","Час заробляти!"],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":77307,"fen":"1b6/1p4k1/p1nq2p1/4pp2/4Q2N/1P1P3B/P3PPK1/8 w - - 0 42","pgn":"{[%csl Rd6,Rf5,Rg6,Rg7][%evp 0,5,178,178,652,655,661,663]} {Q=2} 42. Bxf5 gxf5 {Q=3} 43. Nxf5+  {P=1} Kf8 44. Nxd6 * ","format":27,"texts":["Thanks to the fork, White regains the material with interest.","Існує загроза форка!","Час вилки!"],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":80976,"fen":"1r1r2k1/4b1pp/6b1/5p2/2n1PP2/1NP3P1/P5BP/2R1R1K1 w - - 0 28","pgn":"{[%csl Re7,Rf5,Rg6][%evp 0,3,155,170,146,159]} 28. exf5 Ba3 {[%csl Rg6]} 29. fxg6